<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1460_5233.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Unßer</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fründtlich</unclear> willig <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dienßt</unclear>, unnd was wir
<lb n="2"/>ehren liebs unnd guots vermoegend zuovor from
<lb n="3"/>fürsichtig <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ehrsam</unclear> wyß, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">insonnders</unclear> guot fründt
<lb n="4"/>unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">getrüw</unclear> lieb <orgName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Eydtgnoßen</unclear></orgName>. Nach-
<lb n="5"/>dem uff jüngst gehaltnem tag der <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">jarrechnung</unclear>
<lb n="6"/>zuo <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-53" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Baden</placeName>, die <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">key</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mt</unclear>. durch <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">iren</unclear> gsandten,
<lb n="7"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">vor</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gmeiner</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">dryzechen</unclear> Orten <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">rathsbotten</unclear>,
<lb n="8"/>abermaln umb ein antwort der statt <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-411" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Müll-
<lb n="9"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hußen</unclear></placeName> halber <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">erntstlich</unclear> angehalten, ob man
<lb n="10"/>ir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mt</unclear>. zuo handen deß Hußes <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-91" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Oesterrych</unclear></placeName> Müll-
<lb n="11"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hußen</unclear> gevolgen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">laßen</unclear>, oder darumb mit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ir</unclear>
<lb n="12"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mt</unclear>. das <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fürgschlagen</unclear> recht nach <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">luth</unclear> der erb-
<lb n="13"/>einung <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bruchen</unclear> woelle etc. Unnd uß <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dißerem</unclear>
<lb n="14"/>anlaß die <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gsandten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">üwerer</unclear> und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unßerer</unclear> lieben
<lb n="15"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Eydtgnoßen</unclear> so mit <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-411" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Müllhußen</unclear></placeName> noch im <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">pundt</unclear>
<lb n="16"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">stohnd</unclear>, sampt <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnßeren</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gsandten</unclear>, und den <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ußer</unclear>-
<lb n="17"/>en <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Roden</unclear> deß <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">landts</unclear> <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-8" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Apentzell</unclear></placeName>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">üwere</unclear> und unß-
<lb n="18"/>ere <orgName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Eydtgnoßen</unclear></orgName> von den <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">acht</unclear> Orten so vor jar-
<lb n="19"/>en der statt <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-411" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Müllhußen</unclear></placeName> den <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">pundt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ufgesagt</unclear>,
<lb n="20"/>mit allerley <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erjnnerung</unclear> unnd vermanung
<lb n="21"/>nochmaln <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">erntstlich</unclear> und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fründtlich</unclear> angesprochen,
<lb n="22"/>sy widerumb <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">in</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">pundt</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">anzunemen</unclear>, sy
<lb n="23"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnßer</unclear> <orgName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Eydtgnoßen</unclear></orgName> von den acht Orten aber
<lb n="24"/>daßelbig abgeschlagen, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unnd</unclear> den bscheid <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gegäben</unclear>,
<lb n="25"/>das sy mit <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Müllhußen</unclear> nützit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zeschaffen</unclear>, sich auch
<lb n="26"/>derselben nüt zubeladen gesinnet. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Woell</unclear>-
<lb n="27"/>ind aber <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnßere</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zesamen</unclear> habenden <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">pündt</unclear>,
<lb n="28"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">landtsfriden</unclear> unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verträg</unclear>, was <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">die</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">selben</unclear>
<lb n="29"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ußwyßind</unclear>, halten etc. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Hatt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">daruf</unclear>
<lb n="30"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnßere</unclear>, unnd der übrigen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dryg</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">evangelißch</unclear>-
<lb n="31"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">en</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">stetten</unclear>, sampt <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dero</unclear> von <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-73" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Glaruß</placeName> unnd
<lb n="32"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ußr</unclear> <placeName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Roden</unclear></placeName> deß <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">landts</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Apentzell</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gsandte</unclear>, für
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1460_5234.jpg" n="2"/>
<lb n="33"/>notwendig <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">angesaehen</unclear>, diewyl sich gebüren
<lb n="34"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">waerde</unclear>, dem <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">keyser</unclear> widerumb zeantworten,
<lb n="35"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">darnebent</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ouch</unclear> vorgemelte unnsere eydtgnoß=
<lb n="36"/>en von den acht orten, sich <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">jetz</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuo</unclear> <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-53" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Baden</placeName>,
<lb n="37"/>uff die <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuo</unclear> inen deßhalb beschehne frag <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erclert</unclear>,
<lb n="38"/>das was unns den übrigen mit <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-411" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Müllhusen</unclear></placeName>
<lb n="39"/>noch <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verpündten</unclear> orten, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">irthalber</unclear> begegnen
<lb n="40"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">moechte</unclear>, sy sich <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">desselbigen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nützit</unclear> beladen
<lb n="41"/>wellind, wir unns <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ouch</unclear> von deß <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">waegen</unclear>
<lb n="42"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">kheines</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bystandts</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuo</unclear> inen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zeversehen</unclear>, das
<lb n="43"/>von diser sachen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">waegen</unclear>, ein <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zesammenkhunfft</unclear>
<lb n="44"/>gehalten, unnd ir, sampt <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-411" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Müllhusen</unclear></placeName> und <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-412" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Biel</placeName>
<lb n="45"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ouch</unclear> dahin beschriben werdint, sich mit=
<lb n="46"/>einanderen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zeunderreden</unclear>, mit was <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vernnerem</unclear>
<lb n="47"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bscheid</unclear> man dem <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">keyser</unclear> begegnen. Item
<lb n="48"/>was mit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnseren</unclear> <orgName resp="#ner">eidtgnossen von den acht
<lb n="49"/>orten</orgName> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">der</unclear> sachen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wyter</unclear> zereden sye, und wie
<lb n="50"/>wir die evangelischen ort und zuogwandten
<lb n="51"/>sonsten, by diseren <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gfahrlischen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zyten</unclear>, unnd
<lb n="52"/>denen allerley <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">seltzamen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">inn</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">einer</unclear> <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-750" cert="medium" resp="#ner">eidtgnos</orgName>=
<lb n="53"/>schafft <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">schwaebenden</unclear>, und täglich <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fürgehnden</unclear>
<lb n="54"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">praticken</unclear>, da man <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">den</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">anderen</unclear>, ye lenger
<lb n="55"/>ye minder <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ze</unclear> gfallen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">thuon</unclear> will, unns <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zemen=</unclear>
<lb n="56"/>halten, und gegen ein anderen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zeversehen</unclear>,
<lb n="57"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ouch</unclear> wie wir <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unns</unclear> gegen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnserer</unclear> widerparth,
<lb n="58"/>uff den fal der not (<unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">darvor</unclear> Gott <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">syge</unclear>) er=
<lb n="59"/>zeigen, und ein anderen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuostahn</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">moegind</unclear> unnd
<lb n="60"/>wellind. Welliche <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zesammenkhunfft</unclear>
<lb n="61"/>nun gen <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-51" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Arouw</unclear></placeName> gelegt, und uff <date resp="#ner">sontag den 29ten
<lb n="62"/>diß louffenden monats <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">julii</unclear></date> bestimpt worden,
<lb n="63"/>abents daselbst an der <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">herbrig</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zeerscheinen</unclear>.
<lb n="64"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Dessen</unclear> wir <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">üch</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ouch</unclear> berichten <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">thuond</unclear>, mit eidt=
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1460_5235.jpg" n="3"/>
<lb n="65"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gnoßischem</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">früntlichem</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bgaeren</unclear>, Ir wöllind
