<lb n="67"/>hin wie <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vorgmaeldnt</unclear>, mit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bevelch</unclear> abfertigen,
<lb n="68"/>und durch <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">disaelbig</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">angzeigter</unclear> sachen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">halben</unclear>
<lb n="69"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">rathschlagen</unclear> und handlen helfen, Was
<lb n="70"/>unser aller <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gmeine</unclear> notturfft <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erfordren</unclear>
<lb n="71"/>wirt, Gott bittende, Das er unns ge-
<lb n="72"/>meinlich by frid und einigkeit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ynn</unclear> unnserm
<lb n="73"/>geliebten <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vaterlandt</unclear> under synem schirm
